        <title type="html"><![CDATA[ci(content): compare PR build output]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/46114</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/46114"/>
        <updated>2026-10-12T20:39:28.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=9d0bf7e5c07194485c7f81827005599ecced9712&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Add a workflow that builds base and PR content sequentially in one job, compares their generated output, and publishes page-change and flaw-count statuses.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">Measure whether building both revisions on one runner shortens the comparison workflow while showing the effect of content changes.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Build each revision with its content checkout's <code class="notranslate">@mdn/rari</code> package on the same runner.</li>
<li>Compare generated page files in place, then upload the HTML report and stats.</li>
<li>Publish page counts as <code class="notranslate">content-build-diff</code> and flaw totals as <code class="notranslate">content-build-flaws</code>.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Screenshot:</p>
